      ],
      "justification": "Direct paraphrase of the review step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n7",
        "action:n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the Purchase Order is approved, then reserve the funds for the purchase."
      ],
      "justification": "Condition modeled as action step, followed by XOR branch and the funding action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n9"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "On the other hand, if the Purchase Order is rejected, then rework the order."
      ],
      "justification": "Direct mapping to the rework action on the rejection path."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n10"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once the funds are reserved, send the Order to Suppliers."
      ],
      "justification": "Exact match for the dispatch action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n11"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
